OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's car park plan could be
OL,4,Aknocked back by own councillors
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors are being advised to refuse
OL,7,Ftheir own council's planning
OL,8,Fapplication for extra seafront parking
OL,9,Fspaces over concerns about flooding.
OL,11,FConwy council applied for permission to
OL,12,Fcreate 17 new parking spaces at
OL,13,FLlanfairfechan car park, according to
OL,14,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,15,F(LDRS).
OL,17,FPlanning officers said the proposal
OL,18,Ffails to comply with measures designed
OL,19,Fto reduce flood risk and was deemed
OL,20,F"unacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
